  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kigali HFC implementation plan (Stage I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of the overarching strategy of HFC phase-down management plan for Congo and submission of the first stage. Within the framework of this project, UNIDO will conduct HFC consumption surveys in Congo, will hold meetings with stakeholders and the NOU. these activities will enable UNIDO to determine the overarching strategy for the phase-down of HFC in Congo.</narrative>
  </description>
